\subsubsection{Company-wise Transparency Score Analysis}
\label{sec:company_ts}

Table~\ref{tab:company_breakdown} shows the four score components and the composite Transparency Score for Triveni Turbine Limited (Machinery and Equipment sector, $n{=}36$ peers). The company was selected as an illustrative example because its score is above its sector mean and because all four score components have non-trivial values, making the breakdown informative.

Triveni Turbine's high Specificity (63.46\%) and Clarity (98.08\%) show that most of its 52 narrative segments contain supporting evidence and avoid vague language. Its moderate Completeness (57.99\%) means roughly two-fifths of tracked numerical items were not filed. Its SDG Alignment is 70.59\%, indicating that a substantial share of the UN SDG goals it mentions are linked to evidence-backed disclosures. The composite score is verified exactly by the formula (Eq.~\ref{eq:ts}):
\begin{equation*}
\begin{aligned}
TS &= 0.40 \times 57.99 + 0.30 \times 63.46 \\
   &\quad + 0.20 \times 98.08 + 0.10 \times 70.59 = 68.91.
\end{aligned}
\end{equation*}
At the 94th percentile in its sector, this company ranks among the stronger disclosers in Machinery and Equipment. Fig.~\ref{fig:company_breakdown} visualises the four components.

